 "spec": {
  "title": "Joel Morrow's Volvo spec for 80,000 lb or less",
  "source_url": "https://www.linkedin.com/posts/joel-morrow-a15a6aa0_truck-drivers-and-owner-operators-love-to-activity-7300916238589800448-gCIq",
  "items": [
   {
    "label": "Truck",
    "value": "Volvo VNL 860 sleeper (his Purple Haze II, new-generation VNL); his earlier Purple Haze I is a legacy VNL. Source: Volvo Trucks interview."
   },
   {
    "label": "Engine",
    "value": "D13 Turbo Compound, I-Torque spec, 500 hp / 1,950 lb-ft. Source: Volvo Trucks interview; CCJ, Nov 24, 2025. The 455 / 1,850 rating is shown alongside it for the same 2.16 spec. Source: LinkedIn, Feb 27, 2025."
   },
   {
    "label": "Transmission",
    "value": "I-Shift overdrive with deep reduction: 13-speed on Purple Haze II (LinkedIn, Mar 5, 2025); \"optional 14 speed\" (LinkedIn, Feb 27, 2025)."
   },
   {
    "label": "Rear ratio",
    "value": "2.16 for \"on highway vehicles pulling loads up to 80,000 lbs GCVW\" (LinkedIn, Feb 27, 2025). For a 6x4: \"2.15, 2.16, or 2.17 in an overdrive application provided your transmission has deep enough reduction\" (LinkedIn reply, Sep 2025). Next step he plans: 2.05 (CCJ, Nov 24, 2025)."
   },
   {
    "label": "Axles",
    "value": "Adaptive loading 6x2, lift axle in front of the drive axle, GRAS six-bag air ride (Volvo Trucks interview); Dana S175 23K drive axle (LinkedIn, Mar 5, 2025); 14,600 lb steer axle (CCJ, Nov 24, 2025)."
   },
   {
    "label": "Tires",
    "value": "\"Ultra low rolling resistance Michelin rubber\"; no size given. Source: CCJ, Nov 24, 2025."
   },
   {
    "label": "Weight / duty",
    "value": "General van freight, gross weights up to 79,850 lb (Volvo Trucks interview); spec is for loads up to 80,000 lb GCVW (LinkedIn, Feb 27, 2025)."
   }
  ]
 },
